<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 0.8 pct in April 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 0.8 pct in April 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.8 percent in the April 1-10 period after rising 0.2 percent in the previous 10 days and were 1.1 percent higher than in the March 1-10 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				  APRIL 1-10  MARCH 21-31  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.8	   0.2	  1.1 (0.5)</p>
<p> Bread				0.4	   0.1	  0.6 (0.7)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	   5.0	   0.5	  6.3 (2.2)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.1	   0.2	  0.2 (-0.3)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.7	   0.3	  1.4 (1.5)</p>
<p> Eggs				-0.6	   0.2	 -0.4 (-1.8)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on March 31.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
